{"parse":{"title":"装备图鉴库/超大份口粮袋","pageid":8159,"revid":20598,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%B6%85%E5%A4%A7%E4%BB%BD%E5%8F%A3%E7%B2%AE%E8%A2%8B&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%B6%85%E5%A4%A7%E4%BB%BD%E5%8F%A3%E7%B2%AE%E8%A2%8B&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%B6%85%E5%A4%A7%E4%BB%BD%E5%8F%A3%E7%B2%AE%E8%A2%8B&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"装备图鉴库\">装备图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>超大份口粮袋</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<p><br />\n<span id=\"PNN\" style=\"display: none\">sword_sr</span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"BILIBILI-BOX BOX-4-tr\" style=\"background: rgb(240 236 226 / 70%)\"><div class=\"BOX-2-1\" style=\"\"><div class=\"BOX-title-1\">超大份口粮袋</div>\n<div class=\"BOX-N\" style=\"\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap: wrap\">\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6 pull-right\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%; background:none\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2;\" width=\"35%\"><center><img alt=\"装备全图 超大份口粮袋.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d8/aq9zgulsdnsln8cjc6av4hylzf98q43.png/150px-%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87%E5%85%A8%E5%9B%BE_%E8%B6%85%E5%A4%A7%E4%BB%BD%E5%8F%A3%E7%B2%AE%E8%A2%8B.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d8/aq9zgulsdnsln8cjc6av4hylzf98q43.png/225px-%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87%E5%85%A8%E5%9B%BE_%E8%B6%85%E5%A4%A7%E4%BB%BD%E5%8F%A3%E7%B2%AE%E8%A2%8B.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/d8/aq9zgulsdnsln8cjc6av4hylzf98q43.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"512\" /></center>\n</td>\n<td><center><img alt=\"文字 传说.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/11/a9p2rsox65qsoegwep0y3ng71udi8nm.png/35px-%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97_%E4%BC%A0%E8%AF%B4.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"35\" height=\"20\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/11/a9p2rsox65qsoegwep0y3ng71udi8nm.png/53px-%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97_%E4%BC%A0%E8%AF%B4.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/11/a9p2rsox65qsoegwep0y3ng71udi8nm.png/70px-%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97_%E4%BC%A0%E8%AF%B4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"146\" data-file-height=\"83\" />&#160;&#160;<b>超大份口粮袋</b></center>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><body>\n<div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-around\">\n<div style=\"height:35px; width:48%; display:inline\">\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold\">等级:</span>\n<select id=\"equipement_level\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 28px\" onmousedown=\"selectmousedown(this)\" onblur=\"selectblur(this)\" onchange=\"selectchange(this)\" data-bind=\"value: 等级\">\n<option>1</option><option>2</option><option>3</option><option>4</option><option>5</option><option>6</option><option>7</option><option>8</option>\n<option>9</option><option>10</option><option>11</option><option>12</option><option>13</option><option>14</option><option>15</option><option>16</option>\n<option>17</option><option>18</option><option>19</option><option>20</option><option>21</option><option>22</option><option>23</option><option>24</option>\n<option>25</option><option>26</option><option>27</option><option>28</option><option>29</option><option>30</option><option>31</option><option>32</option>\n<option>33</option><option>34</option><option>35</option><option>36</option><option>37</option><option>38</option><option>39</option><option>40</option><option>41</option><option>42</option><option>43</option><option>44</option><option>45</option><option>46</option><option>47</option><option>48</option>\n<option>49</option><option>50</option><option>51</option><option>52</option><option>53</option><option>54</option><option>55</option><option>56</option>\n<option>57</option><option>58</option><option>59</option><option>60</option>\n</select>\n</div>\n<div style=\"height:35px; width:48%; display:inline\">\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold\">星级:</span>\n<select id=\"equipement_star\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 28px\" onmousedown=\"selectmousedown(this)\" onblur=\"selectblur(this)\" onchange=\"selectchange(this)\" data-bind=\"value: 星级\">\n<option>1</option><option>2</option><option>3</option><option>4</option><option>5</option>\n</select>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-around\">\n<div style=\"height:35px; width:48%; display:flex; justify-content:flex-start; align-items:center\">\n<div style=\"background-color:rgb(118 103 79); width:28px; height:28px; display:flex; justify-content:center\">\n<img src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/44/55wa9v348kdpv7nsqscoku7cs4qcc23.png\">\n</div>\n&nbsp;物攻&nbsp;<span data-bind=\"text: 物攻\"></span>\n</div>\n<div style=\"height:35px; width:48%; display:flex; justify-content:flex-start; align-items:center\">\n<div style=\"background-color:rgb(118 103 79); width:28px; height:28px; display:flex; justify-content:center\">\n<img src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/79/j0f8bpd8k9b3uahxaytk3xttkskvz7r.png\">\n</div>\n&nbsp;魔攻&nbsp;<span data-bind=\"text: 魔攻\"></span>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-around\">\n<div style=\"height:35px; width:48%; display:flex; justify-content:flex-start; align-items:center\">\n<div style=\"background-color:rgb(118 103 79); width:28px; height:28px; display:flex; justify-content:center\">\n<img src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/86/a28jupdnch4m4ux4kcygr3sww8fmi9l.png\">\n</div>\n&nbsp;物防&nbsp;<span data-bind=\"text: 物防\"></span>\n</div>\n<div style=\"height:35px; width:48%; display:flex; justify-content:flex-start; align-items:center\">\n<div style=\"background-color:rgb(118 103 79); width:28px; height:28px; display:flex; justify-content:center\">\n<img src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/9e/nx1g7z11c67ttcj9zkhysaajpbjsqbg.png\">\n</div>\n&nbsp;魔防&nbsp;<span data-bind=\"text: 魔防\"></span>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"display:flex; justify-content:space-around\">\n<div style=\"height:35px; width:48%; display:flex; justify-content:flex-start; align-items:center\">\n<div style=\"background-color:rgb(118 103 79); width:28px; height:28px; display:flex; justify-content:center\">\n<img src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/61/3wiqk8zykmdnzzxx8tyoj9lualhyggu.png\">\n</div>\n&nbsp;生命&nbsp;<span data-bind=\"text: 生命\"></span>\n</div>\n<div style=\"height:35px; width:48%; display:flex; justify-content:flex-start; align-items:center\">\n<div style=\"width:28px; height:28px; display:flex; justify-content:center\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n\n<script src=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/MediaWiki:Knockout.js?action=raw&ctype=text/javascript\"></script>\n<script>\ndata_table={\nsword_sr:[26,0,12,6,70,4.44,0,1.62,1.12,11,8.4,0,3,2,21.9]\n};\n\nfunction selectmousedown(ev) {\n  if (ev.options.length > 5) {\n    ev.size = 6;\n    $(ev).css({\n      \"height\": \"auto\",\n      \"position\": \"absolute\"\n    })\n  } else {\n    $(ev).css(\"height\", \"28px\")\n  }\n}\n\nfunction selectblur(ev) {\n  ev.size = 0;\n  $(ev).css({\n    \"height\": \"28px\",\n    \"width\": \"50px\",\n    \"position\": \"static\"\n  })\n}\n\nfunction selectchange(ev) {\n  ev.size = 0;\n  $(ev).css({\n    \"height\": \"28px\",\n    \"width\": \"50px\",\n    \"position\": \"static\"\n  })\n}\n\nfunction viewModel() {\n    var self = this;\n    self.等级 = ko.observable();\n    self.星级 = ko.observable();\n    self.分类 = document.getElementById(\"PNN\").innerHTML;\n    self.data = data_table[self.分类]\n    \n    <!-- self.物攻 = ko.computed(function() {\n    return parseInt((Number(self.等级())-1)*self.data[5] + self.data[0] + (Number(self.星级())-1)*self.data[10]);\n  }); \n    self.魔攻 = ko.computed(function() {\n    return parseInt((Number(self.等级())-1)*self.data[6] + self.data[1] + (Number(self.星级())-1)*self.data[11]);\n  }); \n    self.物防 = ko.computed(function() {\n    return parseInt((Number(self.等级())-1)*self.data[7] + self.data[2] + (Number(self.星级())-1)*self.data[12]);\n  }); \n    self.魔防 = ko.computed(function() {\n    return parseInt((Number(self.等级())-1)*self.data[8] + self.data[3] + (Number(self.星级())-1)*self.data[13]);\n  }); \n    self.生命 = ko.computed(function() {\n    return parseInt((Number(self.等级())-1)*self.data[9] + self.data[4] + (Number(self.星级())-1)*self.data[14]);\n  }); --> \n}\n\nko.applyBindings(new viewModel());\n</script>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>来源：邂逅星铸神兵池、装备商店兑换星铸神兵·余烬、丰饶商店兑换星铸定影·余烬\n</td>\n<td>*<small>特别声明：目前计算公式还在推算中，个别数值会与真实值存在差别。</small>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-xs-12 col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%; background:none\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"5;\" width=\"10%\"><center><b>装<br />备<br />技<br />能</b><br /><br /></center>\n</td>\n<td><img alt=\"天赋一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/70px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/105px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/140px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />\n<p>免疫[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼速度\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">▼速度</font></span></span>]。拾取己方[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"触发物\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">触发物</font></span></span>]时，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"超大份口粮1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">超大份口粮1</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img alt=\"天赋二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/70px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/105px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/23/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/140px-%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />\n<p>免疫[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼速度\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">▼速度</font></span></span>]。拾取己方[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"触发物\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">触发物</font></span></span>]时，获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"超大份口粮2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">超大份口粮2</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img alt=\"天赋三星.